Shell script automation:
-----------------------
    - instead of running commands manually --> write .sh scripts

    Example:
    --------
    echo "Displaying Jobs"
    java -jar jenkins-cli.jar -s $URL -auth $USER: $TOKEN list.jobs

    Dynamic Input in Scripts:
    -------------------------
    Use read command: read jobname

    Avoid Hardcoding:
    ----------------
    Store values in config file:
        JENKINS_URL=http://localhost:8080
        JENKINS_USER=saikumar
        JENKINS_TOKEN=1234567890